hink you will look back at  your experience with The Bachelor  because it was a jumping-off point for  you to achieve some dreams that you've  worked hard for but at the same time  there were issues with it yeah I think  that and it changed The Bachelor changed  my life completely I'm married my career  path has changed I've made friends  lifelong friends behind the camera some  on the camera with some of the women I  will never forget the experience at the  bachelors giving me and that's why it's  always been hard for me because you  never want to bite the hand that's  feeding you so I'm very grateful and I  acknowledge that what the franchise has  given me but at the same time I have to  be true to myself and hold them  accountable when I feel like they're  doing something wrong so from here how  critical are these next few days and  what do they look like I am expecting  something in the next week but it'll be  at least a couple months before we hear  anything about a lead of color being  announced so I'm waiting to see what  internal changes are made at this point  what I'm doing is for people who look  like me for other for people of  different backgrounds ethnicities I feel  like I'm fighting this fight for them  and their place on the show and I'm very  big on if you have a platform you should  use it I hate the term in  Lewin sir but if I'm going to be labeled  as an influencer let me influence things  in the right direction  and in the right way let me not just be  selling things and posting pretty  pictures you're giving your platform for  purpose and for a reason and I want to  use mine in the right way so that's why  as exhausted as I may be at times I mean  I look totally tired right now even the  lashes aren't healthy as exhausted as I  as I feel I have to remember the reason  behind it thank you so much for taking  the time to do this and you do not look  as tired as you think I was literally  thinking blowing thanks for having me
 

